    "message": "fix(mcp): stop exporting six symbols nothing imports\n\nThe dead-code gate (knip) rejected the branch. `resolveLauncher`,\n`cursorConfigPath`, `opencodeConfigPath` and `MAX_OUTPUT_BYTES` are used\nonly inside their own module, and server.ts re-exported `runCurrentIx`\nand `IxRunResult`, which no caller takes from there — tests import\n`runCurrentIx` from runner.js directly. Only `IxRunner` is genuinely\nconsumed through server.js, so the re-export narrows to that.\n\nLint passes locally either way; knip is the check that catches this, and\nit does not run as part of `npm run lint`.",
